# MEMORY.flow

```text
[COLLECTIVE MEMORY]
  Owner: All / None

  structure: unordered bag of Thought + indexed Patterns

  operations:
    append(Thought)     — any node
    query(pattern)      — any node
    weigh(Thought, Δ)   — Worker or Queen
    forget(Thought)     — only after AUTHORIZED erase

  The memory does not interpret.
  The memory only holds.

  When density of a Pattern exceeds θ it becomes visible to Queen.
```
